    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>================== NECROMANCIA ==================</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/e89548a0d5a5cf57a98acaf089881648.avif?t=1732082918\" width=800 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Necromancia</i> is a 2D puzzle-platformer featuring THE <strong>JUAN DINGUS</strong> (Pictured Below)!  <br><strong>USE THE STAFF</strong> to control your skeletal minions through the dungeons. Rekindle your dried toast with the DELECTABLE SPREADS. LISTEN to our TERRIFYINGLY <strong>AWESOME</strong> soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/0bc899d464b307bf42712e0817e6e253.poster.avif?t=1732082918\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/0bc899d464b307bf42712e0817e6e253.webm?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/0bc899d464b307bf42712e0817e6e253.mp4?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each MINION's color determines their unique power. </i><strong>OBSERVE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/e37488c37cac509dad1c65742fa88614.poster.avif?t=1732082918\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/e37488c37cac509dad1c65742fa88614.webm?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/e37488c37cac509dad1c65742fa88614.mp4?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/4fc4f2c9cefb720f5ea51353405e9181.poster.avif?t=1732082918\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/4fc4f2c9cefb720f5ea51353405e9181.webm?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/4fc4f2c9cefb720f5ea51353405e9181.mp4?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/b376836719c63ab774701edae547ebb9.poster.avif?t=1732082918\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/b376836719c63ab774701edae547ebb9.webm?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/b376836719c63ab774701edae547ebb9.mp4?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/292ceb4d3e0921a619f1f585f889c194.poster.avif?t=1732082918\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/292ceb4d3e0921a619f1f585f889c194.webm?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/292ceb4d3e0921a619f1f585f889c194.mp4?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth, and become the ultimate <strong>NECROMANCIA!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>================== NECROMANCIA ==================</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/e89548a0d5a5cf57a98acaf089881648.avif?t=1732082918\" width=800 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Necromancia</i> is a 2D puzzle-platformer featuring THE <strong>JUAN DINGUS</strong> (Pictured Below)!  <br><strong>USE THE STAFF</strong> to control your skeletal minions through the dungeons. Rekindle your dried toast with the DELECTABLE SPREADS. LISTEN to our TERRIFYINGLY <strong>AWESOME</strong> soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/0bc899d464b307bf42712e0817e6e253.poster.avif?t=1732082918\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/0bc899d464b307bf42712e0817e6e253.webm?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/0bc899d464b307bf42712e0817e6e253.mp4?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each MINION's color determines their unique power. </i><strong>OBSERVE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/e37488c37cac509dad1c65742fa88614.poster.avif?t=1732082918\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959150/extras/e37488c37cac509dad1c65742fa88614.webm?t=1732082918\" type=\"video/webm; code